url: 'https://github.com/ProgrmerJack/Public-Procurement-Control-Surface'
abstract: >-
  Replication data and code for an analysis of 21.6 million
  government contracts across 27 countries (2012-2023),
  identifying Decarbonization Dead Zones in public procurement.
  Implements staggered difference-in-differences (Callaway &
  Sant'Anna 2021), regression discontinuity at the EUR 139,000
  EU threshold, E-PRTR facility-level emissions matching,
  Eurostat within-sector validation, Monte Carlo uncertainty
  quantification, and cross-continental corroboration (US,
  Canada, Australia, World Bank GPPD).
keywords:
  - green public procurement
  - decarbonization dead zones
  - single-bidding
  - carbon intensity
  - difference-in-differences
  - regression discontinuity
  - EXIOBASE
  - supply chain emissions
  - governance
  - EU Directive 2014/24
